    "summary": "Locomotive Engineer Isaiah Price says he has the dream job. He loves driving trains, and says his greatest pleasure comes from moving passengers through his region\u2019s beautiful scenery.    \n\nIsaiah is one of the team of KiwiRail Locomotive Engineers working on the Wairarapa Line, and Main Trunk Line between Wellington and Palmerston North. There are more than 2,000 passenger services travelling through this section of the network in a working week. See his story.",
